    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's so much. everything feels so heavy. i feel like i'm just existing in a space where nothing matters anymore. like everything is already over, i'm just waiting for my body to realize it. when you say it's the logical conclusion... it's the first time someone hasn't told me i'm being selfish for even thinking it. it just feels like the only way to actually find rest.",
